True, barbarians have tons of hitpoints.

But you can manage the risks of nursedancing by selecting the time and 
place carefully. If you wait until your naked AC is low, and you have 
offensive wands or spells, and you have either the spell of teleport 
away or (much more likely) wands of teleport, and you dance on levels 
that are cleared of monsters (and preferably are no-teleport), it's not 
quite the stupid thing it can be otherwise. Think of putting your armor 
back on as the last part of the nurse dance, not as something separate.

